{"about_the_game":"Cassandra Nech is one of the members in the renowned Rogue's Guild, which gathers adventurers and treasure hunters - the most skilled, the bravest, the most resourceful ever. Armed with her trusty crossbow, Antoinette, Cassandra is trying to recover the legendary Sea Tyrant's treasure, who was a long-time forgotten warlord; an easy task, to one like her.<br>Still, things could be not that easy: it looks like someone else is looking for that treasure. Moreover, something dangerous could be hiding in those ancient caves. Something dark and... terrible!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728420/extras/47e475a042c830ef4d1892c2003cbe32.avif?t=1551899933\" width=650 height=247 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A funny, adventurous and original story.<br></li><li>Pixel graphic and retro-style gameplay.<br></li><li>No pixel hunting.<br></li><li>In game hints system.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728420/extras/1ccff435109487969c7f4d8f596739e3.avif?t=1551899933\" width=650 height=839 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"6d0c34dbbb8dbd3ba615e11c8cea5bb16c4d1a81.jpg","localized_name":"Meet Cassandra","name":"Meet Cassandra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/728420/6d0c34dbbb8dbd3ba615e11c8cea5bb16c4d1a81.jpg"},{"icon":"5efbb0823a14f194b54117a9a7ce8ddfb382ca67.jpg","localized_name":"Researcher","name":"Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/728420/5efbb0823a14f194b54117a9a7ce8ddfb382ca67.jpg"},{"icon":"60f61013983e0121808c4fd4a3b7d7fa2c1b54d7.jpg","localized_name":"Violent nature","name":"Violent nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/728420/60f61013983e0121808c4fd4a3b7d7fa2c1b54d7